description=Photon sword Forms for Senator's Martial Arms. Find and read Photon Sword: Form 1 (bookstores, libraries, magazine racks, gyms), ignite a photon sword, and fight with Form 1: seventeen attacks that unlock and grow stronger as its own mastery trains. Choose your Form and its moves in the Photon Sword tab of the martial arts window, or disable Forms to fight with the sword like a katana.
